   "source": [
    "# Multiplication Rule\n",
    "### used to find the probability of two events happening together - i.e., the probability of A and B occuring.\n",
    "\n",
    "## For Independent events:\n",
    "### P(A∩B) = P(A) * P(B)\n",
    "\n",
    "## For Dependent events:\n",
    "### P(A∩B) = P(A) * P(B|A)"
   ]
